]\n```text\nMarcus Lindqvist (marcus-lindqvist, Account manager, North team) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: For the Marlowe rollout at Quarrendon Freight Lines, no action needed: the site is Gate 33.\n```","id":4,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"marcus-lindqvist, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 8; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 14:00: Thanks Dana, noted: the Marlowe rollout deadline at Quarrendon Freight Lines is 22 November. I won't do anything for now. Let me know when you want something done.\n```","id":8,"source_id":"channel-north-random","source":"assistant, #north-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 9; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 14:00: I replied to Dana in a thread on her message in #north-random. I said I'd noted that the Marlowe rollout deadline at Quarrendon Freight Lines is 22 November and that I won't do anything until she asks.\n```","id":9,"source_id":"channel-north-random","source":"assistant, #north-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I replied to Marcus in a thread on his #north-team message. I confirmed that the Marlowe rollout site at Quarrendon Freight Lines is Gate 33 and said nothing more is needed from me. He said no action was needed, so I didn't do anything else.\n```","id":6,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ilse-varga"}
